      "uid": "zhcn:7909920dcaa95f43d8d57531",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我也不是自己喜欢留长发的。这是考虑到头发会因重力垂落，\n或是能够绑起来的优点，百般苦恼后的决定。但是当然──",
      "source_fingerprint": "87f0460a375824e593ac88558ba368c846b32d25b4a67602f7597e404c6fbbd6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
