    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b0bc0fdb26ac96ea225878d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然如此，果然还是该选刚才的猴面包树籽油……\n但是，考虑到渗透率的话，成分还是差了一点……唔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d0faaf48b60dbb5cabd719397b4c4dcef722eff5b9b04c9b6cd3f0dbc1e955f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1023/storytimeline_041023006.json",
      "json_path": [
