      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──唉……我不晓得曾经盼望过几次，\n希望自己能变成白仁那样的直发。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a503922a3fecdb01aa36db872297c4b4e219020e5adc82ac2514971db5e4dc21",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
