    {
      "uid": "zhcn:609c2bccac1aed70aea4a602",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我还记得小时候第一次帮她绑头发时的冲击。\n整齐滑顺又没有打结……害我还大叫居然有这种头发！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7df99dc685b4a838942d30077d8a9a8c6cc7a8628854d722162225c1ac80b05e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
