    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c192ff3b0fc44e80265a32c8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "年幼的我十分懊恼，试着用父亲的发蜡来固定发型……\n但当然无法变得跟白仁一样滑顺。那实在太让我绝望了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c7e475fe359049b46377b711f0abbcce8358d84edbec5998934d7afc3c0e3f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1023/storytimeline_041023006.json",
      "json_path": [
